# Options

"options.report.group.range" : "Report Range Setting"
"options.report.reportRange" : "Report Range"
"options.report.reportRange.detail" : "Sets the range at which bodies can be reported.<br><b>Default</b>: Use the standard range.<br><b>Fixed</b>: Specify the range directly. 5x equals the standard distance.<br><b>Eyesight</b>: Synchronize the range with eyesight. Affected by power outages."
